<title>USA: Fine Host says names James CFO.</title>
<headline>Fine Host says names James CFO.</headline>
<dateline>GREENWICH, Conn. 1997-04-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Fine Host Corp said Wednesday it appointed Catherine James as executive vice president and chief financial officer.</p>
<p>James will succeed Nelson Barber, who will continue to serve as the Company's Senior Vice President and Treasurer.</p>
<p>Since 1989, Ms. James has been a Managing Director of Interlaken Capital, a Greenwich, CT-based investment firm.</p>
